OL,7,     FBreakston. Stars Peter Dyneley,
OL,8,     FJane Hylton & Tetsu Nakamura. A
OL,9,     Fjournalist is given a mysterious
OL,10,     Finjection that turns him into a
OL,11,     Fmurderous monster.
